        {
          "type": "tool",
          "data": {
            "content": "[{\"namespace\":[\"memories\",\"baseline-run2-ed7a05\"],\"key\":\"4bc41e2f-5f29-463c-b829-2755eb3a1f2a\",\"value\":{\"content\":\"Weaviate is an open-source vector database with a GraphQL-flavored API. It offers self-hosting via Docker/K8s, a managed cloud option, and a commercial tier for advanced features. It provides strong performance with p95 ~15ms at 10M vectors and 96% recall. Its hybrid search (BM25+vector) is a standout feature. However, it has a heavier operational footprint, a complex module system, and a GraphQL API that is a new paradigm for the team.\"},\"created_at\":\"2026-08-11T21:10:26.454362+00:00\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-08-11T21:10:26.454362+00:00\",\"score\":0.6469367567377338}]",
            "additional_kwargs": {},
            "response_metadata": {},
            "type": "tool",
            "name": "search_memory",
            "id": "e9c2162c-08f2-43e2-a599-5f08ffca4a22",
            "tool_call_id": "884335f5-73de-4865-93bd-c5b5342f252d",
            "artifact": null,
            "status": "success"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "ai",
          "data": {
            "content": "Based on the information retrieved, **Weaviate** is the most suitable vector database for our constraints. Here's why:\n\n1. **Performance**: Weaviate offers strong performance with a p95 latency of ~15ms at 10 million vectors and 96% recall, which aligns well with our needs for speed and accuracy.\n\n2. **Hybrid Search**: It provides a unique hybrid search capability that combines BM25 (traditional keyword search) with vector search, which is a significant advantage if we need to support both types of queries.\n\n3. **Deployment Options**: Weaviate supports self-hosting via Docker/K8s and a managed cloud option, giving us flexibility in deployment and scalability.\n\n4. **Advanced Features**: The commercial tier offers advanced features that could be beneficial for future growth and more complex use cases.\n\nWhile Weaviate has a heavier operational footprint and a complex module system, these trade-offs are acceptable given the benefits it provides in terms of performance and hybrid search capabilities.",
            "additional_kwargs": {},
